(5641273, 819404, 31535, '<td valign="top">You always do wonders with Rowans eyes. Terrific again. What I don''t like about this image though is the crop at her chin. It feels rather strange in that it is so close to the end of her chin, I''m wondering why it''s cropped at all.</td>', 'You always do wonders with Rowans eyes. Terrific again. What I don''t like about this image though is the crop at her chin. It feels rather strange in that it is so close to the end of her chin, I''m wondering why it''s cropped at all.', '2009-09-09 01:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5641290, 819625, 40718, '<td valign="top">My pick for red.  You did great capturing Iceland (if you aren''t acutally there) and the clouds are, of course, heida.  The fact the model does not command a large portion of the canvas is also a heida touch.  I''m glad you didn''t put her up on the rock and try to copy heida''s shot.  I would have given you a 5 for that, but you get a 9.</td>', 'My pick for red.  You did great capturing Iceland (if you aren''t acutally there) and the clouds are, of course, heida.  The fact the model does not command a large portion of the canvas is also a heida touch.  I''m glad you didn''t put her up on the rock and try to copy heida''s shot.  I would have given you a 5 for that, but you get a 9.', '2009-09-09 01:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5641291, 820191, 40718, '<td valign="top">Model commands only a small portion of the canvas.  Heida.  Burn.  Heida.  Muted tones.  Heida.  Didn''t copy a direct shot.  Check.  My vote for yellow. 8</td>', 'Model commands only a small portion of the canvas.  Heida.  Burn.  Heida.  Muted tones.  Heida.  Didn''t copy a direct shot.  Check.  My vote for yellow. 8', '2009-09-09 01:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
