(5641405, 819530, 31637, '<td valign="top">Nothing stands out here... that tells me this is emulating one of Heida''s fantastic and surreal images. This is a normal scene, no facial expressions for mood, the blue tint doesn''t add enough atmosphere. But if this were a free study a different score maybe.</td>', 'Nothing stands out here... that tells me this is emulating one of Heida''s fantastic and surreal images. This is a normal scene, no facial expressions for mood, the blue tint doesn''t add enough atmosphere. But if this were a free study a different score maybe.', '2009-09-09 03:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
