(5642216, 819264, 100773, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot you have here. Shame that it is the back and not the eyes that are in focus. Beautifull toning, but this is not what I think of when I think about Heida''s style. If she had taken macro work, then it would probably look something like this. SO a bit of a shoehorn, but I got it on after awhile.</td>', 'Great macro shot you have here. Shame that it is the back and not the eyes that are in focus. Beautifull toning, but this is not what I think of when I think about Heida''s style. If she had taken macro work, then it would probably look something like this. SO a bit of a shoehorn, but I got it on after awhile.', '2009-09-09 15:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642217, 819914, 100773, '<td valign="top">Yeah, it''s pretty good =)</td>', 'Yeah, it''s pretty good =)', '2009-09-09 15:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642220, 820125, 100773, '<td valign="top">Oooo, a little more contrats and you would''ve blown me away. Nice one!</td>', 'Oooo, a little more contrats and you would''ve blown me away. Nice one!', '2009-09-09 15:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642223, 819931, 100773, '<td valign="top">True that Heida has a shot similar to this, but I find this to be a bit of a shoehorn entry. This is not very Heida style, other than she has a similar shot. I''ll let you pass on this.</td>', 'True that Heida has a shot similar to this, but I find this to be a bit of a shoehorn entry. This is not very Heida style, other than she has a similar shot. I''ll let you pass on this.', '2009-09-09 15:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642224, 819530, 100773, '<td valign="top">YES! I would''ve liked to see a little more face, but I still say YES!</td>', 'YES! I would''ve liked to see a little more face, but I still say YES!', '2009-09-09 16:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642225, 819683, 100773, '<td valign="top">Not as good as the original, but you got some excellent colors in the background there. I say well done!</td>', 'Not as good as the original, but you got some excellent colors in the background there. I say well done!', '2009-09-09 16:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642230, 820194, 100773, '<td valign="top">Is that the stars and stripes on top of it? Besides from that, the photo is good.</td>', 'Is that the stars and stripes on top of it? Besides from that, the photo is good.', '2009-09-09 16:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642231, 819586, 100773, '<td valign="top">Thank god... finally an entry that at least was relevant to the challenge. Nice entry it was too!</td>', 'Thank god... finally an entry that at least was relevant to the challenge. Nice entry it was too!', '2009-09-09 16:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642236, 820154, 100773, '<td valign="top">Okay, 2nd one of these, humm... Good entry though</td>', 'Okay, 2nd one of these, humm... Good entry though', '2009-09-09 16:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642238, 819451, 100773, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait! A trick I learned somewhere. Desaturate the photo, layer mask and brush over the eyes, then desat again. With a little tweeking you end up with a desaturated/black and white photo with more punch in the eyes.</td>', 'Nice portrait! A trick I learned somewhere. Desaturate the photo, layer mask and brush over the eyes, then desat again. With a little tweeking you end up with a desaturated/black and white photo with more punch in the eyes.', '2009-09-09 16:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642241, 820095, 100773, '<td valign="top">Yes, thank you! I liked this. Needed one of those that I actually can see the relevance in now. Thanks! AND! A good photo as well!</td>', 'Yes, thank you! I liked this. Needed one of those that I actually can see the relevance in now. Thanks! AND! A good photo as well!', '2009-09-09 16:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642249, 819527, 100773, '<td valign="top">wow... That''s a massive... structure thing. Icelandic name as well. Nice photo</td>', 'wow... That''s a massive... structure thing. Icelandic name as well. Nice photo', '2009-09-09 16:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642252, 819660, 100773, '<td valign="top">That''s not a real person, is it? Or is it? Good portaiture nevertheless.</td>', 'That''s not a real person, is it? Or is it? Good portaiture nevertheless.', '2009-09-09 16:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642253, 820156, 100773, '<td valign="top">blurry stuff indeed. Good stuff as well</td>', 'blurry stuff indeed. Good stuff as well', '2009-09-09 16:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642255, 820164, 100773, '<td valign="top">Yeah I see the relevance, and the editing is nice, but I quite don''t get where I want to.</td>', 'Yeah I see the relevance, and the editing is nice, but I quite don''t get where I want to.', '2009-09-09 16:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642257, 820153, 100773, '<td valign="top">I had some trouble with this, but I decided to like it. nice shot</td>', 'I had some trouble with this, but I decided to like it. nice shot', '2009-09-09 16:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642290, 819593, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes.  This is the first one I''ve seen so far that really does look like her work.  You did good! :)</td>', 'Yes.  This is the first one I''ve seen so far that really does look like her work.  You did good! :)', '2009-09-09 16:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642291, 820106, 24454, '<td valign="top">This does look like her kind of pose, doesn''t it.  Nice job.</td>', 'This does look like her kind of pose, doesn''t it.  Nice job.', '2009-09-09 17:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642293, 820181, 24454, '<td valign="top">She does love her cemeteries, doesn''t she :)  Nice job.</td>', 'She does love her cemeteries, doesn''t she :)  Nice job.', '2009-09-09 17:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642295, 819660, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is very haunting and eerie, but I love it!  It does look like her style too.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is very haunting and eerie, but I love it!  It does look like her style too.  Nice job.', '2009-09-09 17:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642298, 819625, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh yes.  You pretty much nailed it!  So far, it is my top pick!</td>', 'Oh yes.  You pretty much nailed it!  So far, it is my top pick!', '2009-09-09 17:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5642300, 819622, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, niiiice job!  Very much having a Heida look.</td>', 'Oh, niiiice job!  Very much having a Heida look.', '2009-09-09 17:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
