(5643477, 819762, 39679, '<td valign="top">Cropping so close takes the hair out of context and really almost makes it look like your model is looking through a curtain which, to me anyway, is the point of the image.  Very clever and well shot</td>', 'Cropping so close takes the hair out of context and really almost makes it look like your model is looking through a curtain which, to me anyway, is the point of the image.  Very clever and well shot', '2009-09-10 20:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
