(5643936, 820081, 100773, '<td valign="top">Much more contrast needed in this shot. It''s not enough to just press the black and white conversion butting on your camera or in your software. Nor do I find this photo very relevant to the challenge. <br/> <br/>I usually come back in a few days to check on some of the images I voted and commented on. The fish tank is very good, I must say, but what puts this photo down is the "thing" on the wall. I doesn''t quite match the tank in quality. I still don''t think this photo is very relevant to the challenge, but I will revote as it turned out to be much better than I remembered. Sorry about that!</td>', 'Much more contrast needed in this shot. It''s not enough to just press the black and white conversion butting on your camera or in your software. Nor do I find this photo very relevant to the challenge.  I usually come back in a few days to check on some of the images I voted and commented on. The fish tank is very good, I must say, but what puts this photo down is the "thing" on the wall. I doesn''t quite match the tank in quality. I still don''t think this photo is very relevant to the challenge, but I will revote as it turned out to be much better than I remembered. Sorry about that!', '2009-09-11 10:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
