(5644196, 820207, 66201, '<td valign="top">Sorry - came back to this. First gave it a 4 and then on clicking, realised I wanted a closer look. Having looked long and hard, I really love the processing.It is gentle and delicate. I think the reason I rushed on in the first viewing was that I was searching for a point of interest. It is a lovely landscape, the scenery is beautiful, but there is a lack of focal subject, or else is there no real path for the eye to follow... not sure. Anyway upped my score to a 6 and am contemplating a 7...</td>', 'Sorry - came back to this. First gave it a 4 and then on clicking, realised I wanted a closer look. Having looked long and hard, I really love the processing.It is gentle and delicate. I think the reason I rushed on in the first viewing was that I was searching for a point of interest. It is a lovely landscape, the scenery is beautiful, but there is a lack of focal subject, or else is there no real path for the eye to follow... not sure. Anyway upped my score to a 6 and am contemplating a 7...', '2009-09-11 17:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644243, 819586, 106806, '<td valign="top">dont vote in categories I entered however this is a great shot, very heida</td>', 'dont vote in categories I entered however this is a great shot, very heida', '2009-09-11 17:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644247, 819770, 106806, '<td valign="top">The hair on the her left side of neck is a bit distracting. Not a critiscim really just looking to recommend improvements as well saying wow and stuff.<br/> <br/>And this is certainly a good picture and well worth looking at.<br/> <br/>My wife is saying how can  I possibly say what I said above. DP is a tough environment and my critique is simply in the vein of seeing a photo and saying how one thinks it could be improved. This is a really great photo.</td>', 'The hair on the her left side of neck is a bit distracting. Not a critiscim really just looking to recommend improvements as well saying wow and stuff. And this is certainly a good picture and well worth looking at. My wife is saying how can  I possibly say what I said above. DP is a tough environment and my critique is simply in the vein of seeing a photo and saying how one thinks it could be improved. This is a really great photo.', '2009-09-11 18:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644249, 819931, 106806, '<td valign="top">real good sense of movement and I love disentanlging the struts of the bridge. Pity the it whites out bottom left but I suspect thats just the way it goes with a shot like this.</td>', 'real good sense of movement and I love disentanlging the struts of the bridge. Pity the it whites out bottom left but I suspect thats just the way it goes with a shot like this.', '2009-09-11 18:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644250, 819445, 106806, '<td valign="top">Great photo, really really great photo. Not quite sure how it conects with the title.</td>', 'Great photo, really really great photo. Not quite sure how it conects with the title.', '2009-09-11 18:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644251, 819530, 106806, '<td valign="top">well taken. Very pleasing shot. Not quite so keen on the railing in the foreground but on the other hand the part that is in focus adds a lot to the shot. Maybe a little more focused?</td>', 'well taken. Very pleasing shot. Not quite so keen on the railing in the foreground but on the other hand the part that is in focus adds a lot to the shot. Maybe a little more focused?', '2009-09-11 18:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644252, 819580, 106806, '<td valign="top">nice composition, find my eye drawn more to the pagoda thingy in the background, perhaps it could be toned down a little?</td>', 'nice composition, find my eye drawn more to the pagoda thingy in the background, perhaps it could be toned down a little?', '2009-09-11 18:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644322, 820041, 100773, '<td valign="top">Sorry, didn''t work for me... I find the ipod...thing disturbing. Very good prosessing though.</td>', 'Sorry, didn''t work for me... I find the ipod...thing disturbing. Very good prosessing though.', '2009-09-11 19:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644323, 819996, 100773, '<td valign="top">My first comment was "Not very Heida in my eyes,", but I have returned to some photos now and had 2nd thoughts. I still think that ther''s something special for it "to be Heida", but I was way to hard on you on my first round. To put it like this: Yes, this could be something that she could''ve shot, but I don''t think this is something special to represent her uniqe style.</td>', 'My first comment was "Not very Heida in my eyes,", but I have returned to some photos now and had 2nd thoughts. I still think that ther''s something special for it "to be Heida", but I was way to hard on you on my first round. To put it like this: Yes, this could be something that she could''ve shot, but I don''t think this is something special to represent her uniqe style.', '2009-09-11 19:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644326, 820196, 100773, '<td valign="top">Heidas photo of a barbed wire was a little bit better I''m afraid... You can hardly see this one because of its rusty color up against the colors in the background.<br/> <br/>If you have photoshop (I think it works in gimp as well), you can convert it to black and white, then use a layer mask to brush the black and white away from the barbed wire, and then do a desaturation of the entire photo. Then you have a black and white photo with a desaturated barbed wire that apears to be black and white, but not quite so it will stand out just enough to be seen.</td>', 'Heidas photo of a barbed wire was a little bit better I''m afraid... You can hardly see this one because of its rusty color up against the colors in the background. If you have photoshop (I think it works in gimp as well), you can convert it to black and white, then use a layer mask to brush the black and white away from the barbed wire, and then do a desaturation of the entire photo. Then you have a black and white photo with a desaturated barbed wire that apears to be black and white, but not quite so it will stand out just enough to be seen.', '2009-09-11 19:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644327, 819762, 100773, '<td valign="top">I find it to artistic. Without the special editing I think you would''ve succeded more.</td>', 'I find it to artistic. Without the special editing I think you would''ve succeded more.', '2009-09-11 19:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644329, 820040, 100773, '<td valign="top">I don''t see it in this photo. It''s a cool photo though, with the sword and everything. But it looks to obvious that there is some kind of filter or something there.</td>', 'I don''t see it in this photo. It''s a cool photo though, with the sword and everything. But it looks to obvious that there is some kind of filter or something there.', '2009-09-11 19:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644330, 820181, 100773, '<td valign="top">Good conversion. Looks like you have used to much USM. I don''t think this is very Heida.<br/> <br/>I come back corrected as Heida realy liked graveyards and stones. Terribly sorry about that!</td>', 'Good conversion. Looks like you have used to much USM. I don''t think this is very Heida. I come back corrected as Heida realy liked graveyards and stones. Terribly sorry about that!', '2009-09-11 19:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644331, 820203, 100773, '<td valign="top">To much for me.</td>', 'To much for me.', '2009-09-11 19:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644333, 819773, 100773, '<td valign="top">Look at the similar Heida shots and compare. I don''t see the Heidatouch in this.</td>', 'Look at the similar Heida shots and compare. I don''t see the Heidatouch in this.', '2009-09-11 19:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644334, 819580, 100773, '<td valign="top">It''s a perfectly OK photo, but I really don''t get any Heida out of this. sorry..</td>', 'It''s a perfectly OK photo, but I really don''t get any Heida out of this. sorry..', '2009-09-11 19:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644335, 819640, 100773, '<td valign="top">I can''t see what you have done to this, but it doesn''t work for me. Had you used the entire house and been a little more carefull about the editing, it would''ve fit the challenge much more. Sorry. On the other hand, it could almost go under some of her "blurry stuff", but then again it''s not blurry enough. I hope you have written some editing details or your aprocah on this photo, cause'' I can make it out.</td>', 'I can''t see what you have done to this, but it doesn''t work for me. Had you used the entire house and been a little more carefull about the editing, it would''ve fit the challenge much more. Sorry. On the other hand, it could almost go under some of her "blurry stuff", but then again it''s not blurry enough. I hope you have written some editing details or your aprocah on this photo, cause'' I can make it out.', '2009-09-11 19:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644338, 820197, 100773, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a typical Heida feel from this. Sorry</td>', 'I don''t get a typical Heida feel from this. Sorry', '2009-09-11 19:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644339, 819263, 100773, '<td valign="top">Something''s is missing here to be Heida"ish"</td>', 'Something''s is missing here to be Heida"ish"', '2009-09-11 19:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644340, 819044, 100773, '<td valign="top">Not sure of the prosessing here. You got a very interesting and popular subject, it''s not nessesary to do all that to him.</td>', 'Not sure of the prosessing here. You got a very interesting and popular subject, it''s not nessesary to do all that to him.', '2009-09-11 19:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644342, 819559, 100773, '<td valign="top">Had it been darker and more black and white and contrasty...</td>', 'Had it been darker and more black and white and contrasty...', '2009-09-11 19:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644343, 819127, 100773, '<td valign="top">Who''s Heilda? What I don''t like about this shot is you can see "pixels" or something in the darker areas. Not good. Challenge relevation on the other hand, maybe. I''m not sure. But the "pixels" there drew to much attention for this to be a succesfull photograph. Sorry. The colors are great, and the photo could be awesome, but I''m afraid it''s ruined.</td>', 'Who''s Heilda? What I don''t like about this shot is you can see "pixels" or something in the darker areas. Not good. Challenge relevation on the other hand, maybe. I''m not sure. But the "pixels" there drew to much attention for this to be a succesfull photograph. Sorry. The colors are great, and the photo could be awesome, but I''m afraid it''s ruined.', '2009-09-11 19:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644348, 819232, 100773, '<td valign="top">I came back to edit my comment as I found a few gravestone shots among Heidas portfolio. Anyway, to light for this to fit the challenge. Photos of a empty gravestone should look like the dead night, not a warm sunny day. Sorry</td>', 'I came back to edit my comment as I found a few gravestone shots among Heidas portfolio. Anyway, to light for this to fit the challenge. Photos of a empty gravestone should look like the dead night, not a warm sunny day. Sorry', '2009-09-11 19:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644350, 819550, 100773, '<td valign="top">Sorry, not a good vote from me..</td>', 'Sorry, not a good vote from me..', '2009-09-11 19:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644351, 819735, 100773, '<td valign="top">Im sorry for my previous and all to harsh comment. It would''v improved the photo alot had the cats head been in focus. As it comes to challenge relevance, I don''t see it. Had you manually focused everything a bit out and added a good black and white toning to it, I suppose it could''ve been something from her blurry stuff.</td>', 'Im sorry for my previous and all to harsh comment. It would''v improved the photo alot had the cats head been in focus. As it comes to challenge relevance, I don''t see it. Had you manually focused everything a bit out and added a good black and white toning to it, I suppose it could''ve been something from her blurry stuff.', '2009-09-11 19:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644390, 820194, 67579, '<td valign="top">I think you captured her style quite well here with the moody sky and great contrast! should easily be in the top 5 :)</td>', 'I think you captured her style quite well here with the moody sky and great contrast! should easily be in the top 5 :)', '2009-09-11 20:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644604, 820204, 66201, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites for this challenge. Although traditionally awkward with the foreground figure out of focus, it does the job of leaving him something of a dark mystery and pulls the eye down the road to the child. The story that''s unfolding goes far beyond the image and off the page. What I find unusual is the fact that he''s looking away from her, and off to the left, behind him...so carrying the story further. The leading path ties it all together. Beautiful processing on the woodland too - wonderful light. Good Luck!</td>', 'This is one of my favourites for this challenge. Although traditionally awkward with the foreground figure out of focus, it does the job of leaving him something of a dark mystery and pulls the eye down the road to the child. The story that''s unfolding goes far beyond the image and off the page. What I find unusual is the fact that he''s looking away from her, and off to the left, behind him...so carrying the story further. The leading path ties it all together. Beautiful processing on the woodland too - wonderful light. Good Luck!', '2009-09-12 03:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644605, 820182, 66201, '<td valign="top">One of my top 5 for the challenge. It''s such an unanticipated moment in time - a capture of the unexpected. Lovely grain. A real tribute to Heida''s "other" style.</td>', 'One of my top 5 for the challenge. It''s such an unanticipated moment in time - a capture of the unexpected. Lovely grain. A real tribute to Heida''s "other" style.', '2009-09-12 03:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644606, 819787, 66201, '<td valign="top">Wow - expecting this in the top 5. Perfect rule of thirds, fantastic desat and a gorgeous model with dramatic hair. Great use of grain for the background.</td>', 'Wow - expecting this in the top 5. Perfect rule of thirds, fantastic desat and a gorgeous model with dramatic hair. Great use of grain for the background.', '2009-09-12 03:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644608, 820044, 66201, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I have looked at this a few times now - it has a Wondering aspect to it. A story is in this and Heida always tells stories in her images. With the advantage of Advanced Editing, I would have cloned out her swim suit tan across her back, to take her out of modern times and make her less of this earth. I expect you are also hearing comments about higher contrast... for this challenge yes - but as a lovely image, it''s just right. 8.</td>', 'Very interesting. I have looked at this a few times now - it has a Wondering aspect to it. A story is in this and Heida always tells stories in her images. With the advantage of Advanced Editing, I would have cloned out her swim suit tan across her back, to take her out of modern times and make her less of this earth. I expect you are also hearing comments about higher contrast... for this challenge yes - but as a lovely image, it''s just right. 8.', '2009-09-12 03:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644703, 820107, 69450, '<td valign="top">fuzzy waves are annoying...smaller aperture would be nice</td>', 'fuzzy waves are annoying...smaller aperture would be nice', '2009-09-12 11:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644705, 819127, 69450, '<td valign="top">hard to rate this with such bad pixelization</td>', 'hard to rate this with such bad pixelization', '2009-09-12 11:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644857, 819709, 83544, '<td valign="top">not really in the style of heida, but oh well at least you''ve tried, I didn''t</td>', 'not really in the style of heida, but oh well at least you''ve tried, I didn''t', '2009-09-12 16:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5644859, 820103, 83544, '<td valign="top">yeap that''s her style indeed but I guess she is more inovative in choosing the places to take a photo</td>', 'yeap that''s her style indeed but I guess she is more inovative in choosing the places to take a photo', '2009-09-12 16:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
