(5644984, 820163, 31637, '<td valign="top">I really like this despite the lack of detail present, the silhouette makes it very imposing. But....doesn''t fit the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this despite the lack of detail present, the silhouette makes it very imposing. But....doesn''t fit the challenge.', '2009-09-12 19:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
