(5648804, 819987, 50695, '<td valign="top">Never before has so little been conveyed by so much. Your title is very apt. A palpable sense of isolation. All this texture to convey emptiness. Remarkable. I give you my Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'Never before has so little been conveyed by so much. Your title is very apt. A palpable sense of isolation. All this texture to convey emptiness. Remarkable. I give you my Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2009-09-15 23:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648805, 819466, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit too stuffy and conventional to give this a ribbon, but really this is the picture that moves me the most. 10</td>', 'I''m a bit too stuffy and conventional to give this a ribbon, but really this is the picture that moves me the most. 10', '2009-09-15 23:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
