(5648854, 819855, 1368, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful!</td>', 'Really beautiful!', '2009-09-16 00:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648855, 819918, 1368, '<td valign="top">I love looking at street photography and wondering about the people in the photos and their lives, what are they doing where are they going, how is their life.... lots of questions, maybey this is not the most beautiful shots of all, but like they say... dont judge a book by its cover... it does have a story and I like that, first photo to make me stop, and this is dark and out of focus so its more mysteroius :)</td>', 'I love looking at street photography and wondering about the people in the photos and their lives, what are they doing where are they going, how is their life.... lots of questions, maybey this is not the most beautiful shots of all, but like they say... dont judge a book by its cover... it does have a story and I like that, first photo to make me stop, and this is dark and out of focus so its more mysteroius :)', '2009-09-16 00:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648861, 819451, 50641, '<td valign="top">if Heida were in here, i would not be surprised if she entered this.   i don''t quite know why.  somehow it seems to fit the arc of her work. <br/>great tones and it looks like a movie still.</td>', 'if Heida were in here, i would not be surprised if she entered this.   i don''t quite know why.  somehow it seems to fit the arc of her work. great tones and it looks like a movie still.', '2009-09-16 00:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648862, 819451, 1368, '<td valign="top">its very pretty, reminds my of like old time movie star I wonder if you are telling her something or she is seeing something cause it looks like the mouth is in the middle of going from no smiling to smiling or maybe even a little shyness there</td>', 'its very pretty, reminds my of like old time movie star I wonder if you are telling her something or she is seeing something cause it looks like the mouth is in the middle of going from no smiling to smiling or maybe even a little shyness there', '2009-09-16 00:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
