(5648882, 820095, 39349, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, great composition and post work. 10</td>', 'Fantastic shot, great composition and post work. 10', '2009-09-16 00:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648888, 820044, 39349, '<td valign="top">I almost want to see this shot with a different crop. I think the negative space on the left could be cropped out a bit and some dodging on her back and face to draw your eye to her. Right now my eye pulls left to the background. You did make the right choice to go b/w and it''s a lovely setup.</td>', 'I almost want to see this shot with a different crop. I think the negative space on the left could be cropped out a bit and some dodging on her back and face to draw your eye to her. Right now my eye pulls left to the background. You did make the right choice to go b/w and it''s a lovely setup.', '2009-09-16 00:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648889, 820191, 39349, '<td valign="top">10, 10, and 10. this shot is simply dead on for this challenge. Love the crisp foreground and the softness of the background. Hope to see this on the front page.</td>', '10, 10, and 10. this shot is simply dead on for this challenge. Love the crisp foreground and the softness of the background. Hope to see this on the front page.', '2009-09-16 00:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648890, 819849, 39349, '<td valign="top">Super cool image. My only suggestion would have been to clone out the little bushes in the right hand side of the frame. Great post work, the duo tone works well here.</td>', 'Super cool image. My only suggestion would have been to clone out the little bushes in the right hand side of the frame. Great post work, the duo tone works well here.', '2009-09-16 00:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648896, 820201, 39349, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too much dodging on her face IMHO but nothing to knock off points for. looks like you had a mixture of lighting going on here, some incandescent on the back light and florescent on the left? I''m kind of digging it, the cool and warm tones work here I think.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too much dodging on her face IMHO but nothing to knock off points for. looks like you had a mixture of lighting going on here, some incandescent on the back light and florescent on the left? I''m kind of digging it, the cool and warm tones work here I think.', '2009-09-16 00:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648928, 820204, 27161, '<td valign="top">Hah awesome job!  I''m glad I gave this one a 10.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-16 00:02:42.</i></td>', 'Hah awesome job!  I''m glad I gave this one a 10.', '2009-09-16 01:02:17.000000', '2009-09-16 01:02:42.000000', 0),
