(5648942, 820191, 62357, '<td valign="top">Well done Rina on getting a well deserved ribbon.  Crikey, what a great score.  Ordinarily this would give you a blue.  As you know, I was away during this challenge so didn''t get to vote.  This is a really lovely image.</td>', 'Well done Rina on getting a well deserved ribbon.  Crikey, what a great score.  Ordinarily this would give you a blue.  As you know, I was away during this challenge so didn''t get to vote.  This is a really lovely image.', '2009-09-16 01:06:23.000000', NULL, 0),
