(5648951, 820204, 32011, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you made the top 10 of this challenge... anything less would have been criminal.<br/> <br/>This was one of my favourites in the challenge... thought it was worthy of a ribbon or an HM at least... but I guess one can never predict what the DPC voters will do from one challenge to the next.  Well done, and it''s great to see you here again.</td>', 'I''m glad you made the top 10 of this challenge... anything less would have been criminal. This was one of my favourites in the challenge... thought it was worthy of a ribbon or an HM at least... but I guess one can never predict what the DPC voters will do from one challenge to the next.  Well done, and it''s great to see you here again.', '2009-09-16 01:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5648953, 819855, 62357, '<td valign="top">Juliet, this is amazing.  What a fantastic score too. Congrats on the red ribbon.</td>', 'Juliet, this is amazing.  What a fantastic score too. Congrats on the red ribbon.', '2009-09-16 01:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
