(5649935, 820204, 28322, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of Charles Chaplin who came 3rd in a competition imitating Charles Chaplin :) <br/>First thank to DPC who brought up to our attention your portfolio, it is one of the gems in here. I thought to PM you letting you know about it, but I knew for sure you''ll get to know. <br/>I was wondering if you just gunna set back relax watching DPC compete, or you''d dare to join, glad you did :) <br/> <br/>Now a question, how do you feel knowing there are 9 people who can steel your photography identity without any one noticing lol :)<br/> <br/>It was fun, it was a pleasure, <br/>one last thing " Don''t disappear again " :)</td>', 'This reminds me of Charles Chaplin who came 3rd in a competition imitating Charles Chaplin :) First thank to DPC who brought up to our attention your portfolio, it is one of the gems in here. I thought to PM you letting you know about it, but I knew for sure you''ll get to know. I was wondering if you just gunna set back relax watching DPC compete, or you''d dare to join, glad you did :)  Now a question, how do you feel knowing there are 9 people who can steel your photography identity without any one noticing lol :) It was fun, it was a pleasure, one last thing " Don''t disappear again " :)', '2009-09-16 13:39:02.000000', NULL, 0),
