(5649993, 819453, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think this is an outstanding tribute to her work -- and what a heartstopping photo of that beautiful little girl!  I think for the long haul when the challenge is forgotten -- this crop of her face will be so much more meaningful than it would have the other way.  It is breathtaking!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I think this is an outstanding tribute to her work -- and what a heartstopping photo of that beautiful little girl!  I think for the long haul when the challenge is forgotten -- this crop of her face will be so much more meaningful than it would have the other way.  It is breathtaking! ', '2009-09-16 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
