(5650081, 820093, 50641, '<td valign="top">Love the way that railing is now a crown of dangerous spikes.  In a way, your photo certainly does fit <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=39850" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">macrothing</a>''s assessment of Heida''s style:  It''s an innocent scene that has been processed (by time) to look dark and malignant.  Keep this location in mind when the Halloween challenges come around!</td>', 'Love the way that railing is now a crown of dangerous spikes.  In a way, your photo certainly does fit  macrothing''s assessment of Heida''s style:  It''s an innocent scene that has been processed (by time) to look dark and malignant.  Keep this location in mind when the Halloween challenges come around!', '2009-09-16 15:41:07.000000', NULL, 0),
