(5650995, 819533, 101668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BJamy:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice editing, messy frame, not that interesting, but fits the challenge. Makes you wonder what score I gave you, right? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>He gave you a 5. I gave you an 8.<br/> <br/>I''m surprised this ended up so low. I guess dpc doesn''t like speckles. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks Don, it makes me feel better a lot. I liked the image that is why I entered it. This was the 100th shot and rather candid.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Originally posted by BJamy: Nice editing, messy frame, not that interesting, but fits the challenge. Makes you wonder what score I gave you, right?   He gave you a 5. I gave you an 8. I''m surprised this ended up so low. I guess dpc doesn''t like speckles.  Thanks Don, it makes me feel better a lot. I liked the image that is why I entered it. This was the 100th shot and rather candid.', '2009-09-17 01:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
