(5653119, 819451, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>You asked for this shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>I really liked this shot and gave it high score in the challenge<br/> <br/>This reeks of 1940-50''s with the lipstick, very simple and clean.<br/> <br/>There is not a lot I can say that could improve this shot, maybe, just maybe saturating the eyes and a tiny bit of dodge and burn before turning this to black and white would have given the eyes some more depth.  <br/> <br/>But this is a fabulous shot</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club You asked for this shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club. I really liked this shot and gave it high score in the challenge This reeks of 1940-50''s with the lipstick, very simple and clean. There is not a lot I can say that could improve this shot, maybe, just maybe saturating the eyes and a tiny bit of dodge and burn before turning this to black and white would have given the eyes some more depth.   But this is a fabulous shot', '2009-09-18 20:50:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5653122, 819978, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>You asked for this shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>I gave this a 5 when it was in voting, here are the reasons why. With this being a Heida challenge, I expected a little more punch to the photograph.  Moving closer to the tree, so that was the focal point.  Instead I find my eye travelling all over the page.<br/> <br/>A little more sharpness and boost in colours would have gone a long way too.  Funnily enough, you used every single bit of the 720, but I am finding it too large.  So maybe chopping off the bottom of the shot so it is closer to the tree would have helped with this. <br/> <br/>this is a lovely landscape shot</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club You asked for this shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club. I gave this a 5 when it was in voting, here are the reasons why. With this being a Heida challenge, I expected a little more punch to the photograph.  Moving closer to the tree, so that was the focal point.  Instead I find my eye travelling all over the page. A little more sharpness and boost in colours would have gone a long way too.  Funnily enough, you used every single bit of the 720, but I am finding it too large.  So maybe chopping off the bottom of the shot so it is closer to the tree would have helped with this.  this is a lovely landscape shot', '2009-09-18 20:54:58.000000', NULL, 0),
