(5654246, 819127, 104220, '<td valign="top">Hi Everbody,<br/> <br/>I can''t tell you enough about how devastated I am with the<br/>quality and pixels in the image I uploaded...!!!<br/> <br/>I don''t know WHY it finished off looking the way it did...<br/> <br/>For a full view of the picture, feel free to check it out<br/>here ----- <a href="//farm3.static.flickr.com/2425/3880988352_5348b56a2c_b.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//farm3.static.flickr.com/2425/3880988352_5348b56a2c_b.jpg</a> <br/> <br/>I spoke with DPC but as voting had started, I couldn''t upload a fresh image<br/>and if I had removed it, then there was in the rules about removing images so<br/>I left it..<br/> <br/>Thanks anyway for voting and I really am so sorry about the quality. I really<br/>don''t know how it happened..<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/> <br/>Jon</td>', 'Hi Everbody, I can''t tell you enough about how devastated I am with thequality and pixels in the image I uploaded...!!! I don''t know WHY it finished off looking the way it did... For a full view of the picture, feel free to check it outhere ----- //farm3.static.flickr.com/2425/3880988352_5348b56a2c_b.jpg  I spoke with DPC but as voting had started, I couldn''t upload a fresh imageand if I had removed it, then there was in the rules about removing images soI left it.. Thanks anyway for voting and I really am so sorry about the quality. I reallydon''t know how it happened.. Regards, Jon', '2009-09-20 06:31:10.000000', NULL, 0),
