(5957204, 819625, 105957, '<td valign="top">For those interested, I had one homemade reflector (cardboard and aluminum foil) otherwise just ambient light. The PP was 1 RAW file developed twice, once for the sky and once for the foreground. Some dodge and burn, sharpening and other tweaks :-)<br/>And thanx again for all you nice comments, views and votes;-)</td>', 'For those interested, I had one homemade reflector (cardboard and aluminum foil) otherwise just ambient light. The PP was 1 RAW file developed twice, once for the sky and once for the foreground. Some dodge and burn, sharpening and other tweaks :-)And thanx again for all you nice comments, views and votes;-)', '2010-04-20 06:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5984700, 819451, 23317, '<td valign="top">Like gsals Big Girl Now, this is one of those shots I keep going back to and viewing over and over again.  Agree with everyone else that the shot has such a ''50s movie star feel to it.  I''m surprised it hasn''t received more favorites in 9 months.</td>', 'Like gsals Big Girl Now, this is one of those shots I keep going back to and viewing over and over again.  Agree with everyone else that the shot has such a ''50s movie star feel to it.  I''m surprised it hasn''t received more favorites in 9 months.', '2010-05-02 17:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
